-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-best-sulcata-tortoise-names-60-ideas-for-every-sulcata-tortoise-owner/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🐱</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Sulcata Tortoise Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">The Ultimate Guide to Best Sulcata Tortoise Names: 60+ Ideas for Every Sulcata Tortoise Owner</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">From seasonal favorites inspirations to classic favorites, discover 60+ best sulcata tortoise names that capture your sulcata tortoise&#x27;s unique personality.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-fluffy-tenrec-names-70-ideas-for-every-tenrec-owner/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🐾</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Tenrec Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">The Ultimate Guide to Fluffy Tenrec Names: 70+ Ideas for Every Tenrec Owner</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">From inspired by sports inspirations to classic favorites, discover 70+ fluffy tenrec names that capture your tenrec&#x27;s unique personality.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/funny-macaque-names-inspired-by-music-60-funny-ideas-for-your-macaque/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🐾</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Macaque Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Funny Macaque Names Inspired by Music: 60+ Funny Ideas for Your Macaque</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Looking for funny macaque names? Discover 60+ funny ideas inspired by music for your beloved macaque companion.</p></a></div></section><nav class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" aria-label=\"Post navigation\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\" href=\"/blog/funny-cat-names-inspired-by-movies/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">← Previous Post</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Funny Cat Names Inspired By Movies: 50+ Cinematic Ideas For Your Feline Star</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\" href=\"/blog/unique-rabbit-names-for-male-pets/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Next Post →</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Unique Rabbit Names For Male Pets: 80+ Handpicked Ideas</p></a></nav><div class=\"mt-12 p-6 bg-primary/5 rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 text-center\"><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">🐾 Ready to find the perfect animal name?</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Browse our complete collection of 200+ animal name generators — all 100% free.</p><a class=\"inline-block bg-primary text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors\" href=\"/animals/\">Browse All Animals →</a></div></article><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-gray-400 py-10\" aria-label=\"Site footer\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8\"><div><h4 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-3\">Company</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about/\">About</a></li><li><a cl